1
00:00:00,701 --> 00:00:03,701
(Leonard:)On a road.

2
00:00:03,704 --> 00:00:05,834
(Leonard:)Wasn't even that
hard to find.

3
00:00:08,808 --> 00:00:10,138
This is so amazing!

4
00:00:10,144 --> 00:00:11,874
I know!

5
00:00:13,113 --> 00:00:14,583
(Leonard:)You want to
get a picture?

6
00:00:14,582 --> 00:00:16,082
(Sheldon:)I want more than a picture.

7
00:00:16,083 --> 00:00:17,413
(Sheldon:)I want to go in.

8
00:00:17,418 --> 00:00:19,088
(Leonard:)Well, so do I, but
they'll never let us.

9
00:00:19,086 --> 00:00:22,486
(Sheldon:)Is that the attitude
that helped you get Penny?

10
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:24,490
(Leonard:)No, but I don't have three years

11
00:00:24,492 --> 00:00:26,622
(Leonard:)to make that gate
feel sorry for me.

12
00:00:28,595 --> 00:00:30,595
Uh, there's
a speaker box.

13
00:00:30,598 --> 00:00:33,998
(Sheldon:)Drive up, push the button,
and let's see what happens.

14
00:00:35,001 --> 00:00:36,671
(Leonard:)Okay, yeah.

15
00:00:36,671 --> 00:00:39,101
(Leonard:)What do we
have to lose?

16
00:00:47,013 --> 00:00:48,613
(Leonard:)I'm a little nervous.

17
00:00:48,616 --> 00:00:51,286
(Sheldon:)Well, get over it.

18
00:00:51,285 --> 00:00:53,955
(Sheldon:)Confidence is key
in these situations.

19
00:00:53,955 --> 00:00:55,685
(Sheldon:)Right.

20
00:00:56,957 --> 00:01:00,027
(gasps) You pushed it--
are you out of your mind?!

